Subject: [PATCH] feat: record voice in higher quality

---
 Telegram/CMakeLists.txt                          |  2 ++
 .../media/audio/media_audio_capture.cpp          |  3 ++-
 Telegram/SourceFiles/settings/settings_tele.cpp  |  4 ++++
